{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChACty8DnKrGf5gqznSBb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```python\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\ndef days_between(date1: str, date2: str, fmt: str = \"%Y-%m-%d\") -> int:\n    \"\"\"回傳兩個日期字串相差的天數（絕對值）。\n\n    >>> days_between(\"2026-01-01\", \"2026-11-18\")\n    321\n    \"\"\"\n    d1 = datetime.strptime(date1, fmt).date()\n    d2 = datetime.strptime(date2, fmt).date()\n    return abs((d2 - d1).days)\n```\n\n用法：\n\n```python\nprint(days_between(\"2026-01-01\", \"2026-11-18\"))          # 321\nprint(days_between(\"2026/11/18\", \"2026/01/01\", \"%Y/%m/%d\"))  # 321\n```\n\n- 預設格式是 `YYYY-MM-DD`。日期如果用其他寫法，就把格式傳給 `fmt` 參數，例如 `\"%Y/%m/%d\"`、`\"%d-%m-%Y\"`。\n- 函式回傳的是絕對值，兩個日期誰先誰後都不影響結果。如果需要正負號來分辨先後，就把 `abs()` 拿掉。\n- 字串格式不符或日期不存在時（例如 `2026-02-30`），程式會丟出 `ValueError`。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5580,"cache_read_input_tokens":29283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5580},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e4a4aa6-7ea2-47a1-9246-636a1ccacc06","uuid":"7e27119f-0b12-451d-9a4a-ed955d135e9c","timestamp":"2026-11-18T10:05:45.896Z","request_id":"req_011ChACtxynm8joT48bycsLe"}
